  ('2026-05-09T13:23:17.332076+00:00'::timestamptz, 'home-property-services/landscaping-lawn-care', 'Murray’s Landscape Services', 'Durham-based landscaping/lawn-care company serving the Triangle, including Chapel Hill, Hillsborough, and Raleigh.', 'Landscape maintenance, plant installation, irrigation install/maintenance, walkways/patios/retaining walls, drainage, artificial turf, aeration/overseeding, mulch/pine straw, pruning/cleanup, turf care, snow removal.', '{}'::text[], 'blake@murraylandscapeservices.com', '(919) 795-9885', 'Durham', 'https://www.murrayslandscapeservices.com/', 'active', 'https://images.briarchapelconnect.com/service-images/catalog/landscaping-lawn-care/murrays-landscape-services.webp'),
