  ('2026-05-09T14:57:05.769917+00:00'::timestamptz, 'home-property-services/plumbing-electrical-hvac', 'Swift Brothers', 'Multi-location residential services company; the Chapel Hill HVAC, and electrical service.', 'Leak repair, faucet replacement, water heaters, water filtration, well pumps; HVAC inspection/repair/maintenance/installation and air quality accessories; backup generators, panel upgrades, inspections, indoor/outdoor lighting, surge protectors.', '{}'::text[], NULL, '(984)-360-6117', 'Durham', 'https://www.swiftbrothers.com', 'active', 'https://images.briarchapelconnect.com/service-images/catalog/plumbing-electrical-hvac/swift-brothers.webp'),
